SDV aebsc:

VSS :
    Sensor Signal Camera (SSP:5+/-0ms, DL: 1+/-0ms)
    Sensor Signal Lidar (SSP:5+/-0ms, DL: 1+/-0ms)
    Sensor Signal Radar (SSP:5+/-0ms, DL: 1+/-0ms)
    Actuator Signal Brake (periodic 5+/-0ms, AD: 1+/-0ms)    
    Actuator Signal Alarm (triggered on event, AD: 1+/-0ms)
App :
    Component Data_hub
        service Fuse_detection:
            subscribe to VSS signal Lidar (Lidar)
            subscribe to VSS signal Radar (Radar)
            publish Detection_data
            periodic 5+/-0ms
            ExecTime 1+/-0ms
        service Fuse_camera:
            subscribe to VSS signal Camera (Camera)
            subscribe to Processed_detection (Processed_detection)
            publish to VSS signal Alarm (Alarm)
            publish Reaction_data
            periodic 5+/-0ms
            ExecTime 1+/-0ms
    Component AEB_controler
        service Compute_detection:
            subscribe to Detection_data (Detection_data)
            publish Processed_detection
            triggered on Detection_data
            ExecTime 1+/-0ms
        service Compute_reaction:
            subscribe to Reaction_data (Reaction_data)
            publish to VSS signal Alarm (Alarm)
            publish to VSS signal Brake (Brake)
            triggered on Reaction_data
            ExecTime 1+/-0ms

Functional Chains:
    chain :
    Camera -> 
    Fuse_detection ->
    Compute_detection ->
    Fuse_camera ->
    Compute_reaction ->
    Brake